# The frontend calls the API at the relative path /api and needs no build-time
# configuration. Express serves the built frontend from the same origin, so
# there is no separate API host to configure.
#
# Do NOT reintroduce REACT_APP_API_URL with an absolute URL. Create React App
# inlines these at build time, so an absolute localhost value would be compiled
# into the bundle and every participant's browser would call their own machine.
